# Experiments (configs, job scripts, analysis code, results) are not kept in git. They travel by rsync
# between machines; each experiment's README is its record (see the experiment-layout skill). The index of
# all experiments, experiments/README.md, is tracked so it survives clones and pulls.
experiments/*
!experiments/README.md
